{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Leaks in Space</strong> is a 2D sandbox space sim featuring Combat, Ship building, Mining, Trading and Exploring a procedurally generated galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/psg.png?t=1746868897\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover and explore ever-changing star sectors teeming with derelict ships, abandoned stations and hidden relics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/combat.png?t=1746868897\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An unique ship pressure health system. Every damage creates a stackable leak that gradually reduces ship's pressure over time. Patch them during combat or risk total shutdown or retreat to a station for full repairs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/build.png?t=1746868897\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design and build your own ship part by part to suit your style, Customize it for combat, trading, mining, or salvaging. Upgrade engines, weapons, cargo holds, and pressure regulators to survive the dangers of deep space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/trade.png?t=1746868897\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect resources by mining asteroids or salvaging derelict ships, then sell your loot at space stations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3561170?t=1746868897","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/6b7c1e6de55a59bf0c50452f95ce267df49f93c4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746868897","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/fa51d6b5872ae2ffd273902f35ae48cd7eb90538/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746868897","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/fa51d6b5872ae2ffd273902f35ae48cd7eb90538/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746868897","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Leaks in Space</strong> is a 2D sandbox space sim featuring Combat, Ship building, Mining, Trading and Exploring a procedurally generated galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/psg.png?t=1746868897\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover and explore ever-changing star sectors teeming with derelict ships, abandoned stations and hidden relics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/combat.png?t=1746868897\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An unique ship pressure health system. Every damage creates a stackable leak that gradually reduces ship's pressure over time. Patch them during combat or risk total shutdown or retreat to a station for full repairs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/build.png?t=1746868897\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design and build your own ship part by part to suit your style, Customize it for combat, trading, mining, or salvaging. Upgrade engines, weapons, cargo holds, and pressure regulators to survive the dangers of deep space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/trade.png?t=1746868897\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect resources by mining asteroids or salvaging derelict ships, then sell your loot at space stations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p>","developers":["Frostech Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/12e7a10aae217c9cd94490684a52a732cecb9165/header.jpg?t=1746868897","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257133765,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133765/movie480.mp4?t=1746795569","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133765/movie_max.mp4?t=1746795569"},"name":"Leaks In Space Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257133765/c35da382052d1ffc9c4cf6e41dd0909467ce33bd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746795569","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133765/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746795569","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133765/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746795569"}}],"name":"Leaks In Space","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit pro